Subject: [PATCH 06854/11362] [outer-loop] ARC g50t round-3: honest over-budget
 null, L4 tongue mechanic refined

Round-3 codex gpt-5.6-sol attempt on g50t: refines round-2's L4 tongue
control (exact coords: enter center color-8 assembly from (32,20) moving
down, left head shifts x=8->x=14, snaps back on release) and maps further
past the opened shaft (middle corridor, color-15 rail near x=26, lower
corridor near y=50), but the attempted tail did not win. Discovers ACTION5
after both commit slots are used clears ghosts and resets the current
level (cheap retry, preserves levels_completed).

Source agent self-flagged an over-budget accounting error (two async
118-step prefix replays initially uncollected; corrected total 833 steps
vs 600-step round-3 budget) and explicitly marked this an honest null that
must not count as a campaign advance. No new level banked;
reproducible_total_levels unaffected (still 144).

